cosmic-utils-monorepo (1.5.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * clippy-land: PATH-based .desktop Exec (no staging /export prefix)
    and persist clipboard history across restarts (load/save max_history;
    missing pinned deserializes as true).
  * cosmic-ext-applet-dict: default to upstream embedded sqlite; optional
    local dictd via dict_server; keep IPC --toggle shortcut.

